                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On May 22, 1947, President Truman signed Public Law 75, an Act to Provide
                    Assistance to Greece and Turkey; for text, see 61 Stat. 103. The statement made
                    by the President at the signing of the legislation, as well as the texts of the
                    Act and of the regulations for carrying out its provisions (Executive Order
                    9857, May 22), are printed in Department of State <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bulletin</hi>, June 1, 1947, pages 1070–1073.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
